.claude/plans/PLAN-198/repass-rc1/claude-rc1-09.verdict.txt:30:How it fails: if _lib or _lib/_night_mode_parts is missing or only partly installed, the script dies with a traceback (exit 1) before main(). It writes neither the night-mode-event line nor the night_mode_toggled row. The docstring promises both records on "EVERY terminating path" of on/off, and exit 2 for refusals. This is an infrastructure fault that happens before any write, so the failure stays on the safe side.
